_model: definition
---
title: Definition 1
---
order: 1
---
short_label: IV.Def.1
---
statement: A rectilinear figure is said to be <i>inscribed in a rectilinear figure</i> when the respective angles of the inscribed figure lie on the respective sides of that in which it is inscribed.
---
group: defIV1_7
---
